description: --target linear ships with a leaking allocator (M1, docs/LINEAR-TARGET-SPEC.md). M2 is a mark-sweep over flat memory with a shadow stack, so wazero and other non-GC hosts can run long programs. Depends on what the shared runtime core decides a target allocates.

